# Protected coordination source docs (raw NSF/budget/personnel material).
# The *derived*, sanitized coordination plan under project_coordination/ IS tracked
# and public; the raw source binaries here are kept out of git by default.
# To publish a specific source doc, add an explicit exception (e.g. `!project_docs/PUBLIC.pdf`).
project_docs/*.pdf
project_docs/*.docx
project_docs/*.xlsx
project_docs/*.pptx

